TitanOS-Office

T-Word, T-PDF, T-Exel, T-Deck, T-CAD, T-Fig, T-Film, T-Light, T-Vector,
T-Design, T-Effect, T-Sound, T-Texture and T-Material are modified versions of
WordCraft, PdfCraft, GridCraft, DeckCraft, CADCraft, FigCraft, FilmCraft,
LightCraft, VectorCraft, DesignCraft, EffectCraft, SoundCraft, TextureCraft and
MaterialCraft by the ArtCraft Team and their contributors
(https://github.com/storytold/<name in lower case>), licensed
MIT OR Apache-2.0. The original licence texts and notices are kept
in each folder (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE, NOTICE, ATTRIBUTION*).

Changes for TitanOS (2026, the TitanOS contributors):
- the ArtCraft name, wordmark and logos are removed (docs/brand/ of the
  originals, LicenseRef-Storyteller-Trademark: forks must remove them);
- the programs carry the names listed above (T-Word ... T-Material);
- the dependencies on storytold's forks of craft-libs, egui, winit and
  winprint.rs point to copies under github.com/ra5on (same commits).

Vendored third-party code (unchanged, MIT OR Apache-2.0):
- t-effect/vendor/filmcraft: the FilmCraft crates EffectCraft uses, from
  https://github.com/storytold/filmcraft at d5ead4ba1ee2f1cd13cb86a4239aee2730a3d9f5
  (ArtCraft Team and the FilmCraft contributors); only the workspace manifest
  is trimmed to these crates;
- t-design/vendor/indd: indd-utils, from https://github.com/storytold/indd-utils
  at 7f3060e5bce78d21ea70e0d5eacb96edce15dfbe (aiongg and the indd-utils
  contributors).

Bundled fonts added for TitanOS (SIL Open Font License 1.1, licence texts
next to the files in <app>/assets/fonts/):
- Carlito (metric-compatible with Calibri) and Caladea (with Cambria), from
  https://github.com/google/fonts (ofl/carlito, ofl/caladea);
- Liberation Sans, Serif and Mono 2.1.5 (with Arial, Times New Roman and
  Courier New), from https://github.com/liberationfonts/liberation-fonts.
In t-word (all twenty faces; new documents use Carlito) and t-exel (Carlito,
Liberation Serif and Mono, for the cells of the web version).
